+### Including multiple mapping configurations
+
+The `IncludeMappingConfigurationAttribute` can be applied multiple times to the same method.
+This is useful to compose a mapping out of several reusable configurations, e.g. one per implemented interface:
+
+```csharp
+[Mapper]
+public static partial class BaseMapper
+{
+    [MapProperty(nameof(IAudit.CreatedBy), nameof(IAuditDto.Creator))]
+    public static partial void MapAudit(IAudit audit, IAuditDto auditDto);
+
+    [MapProperty(nameof(IOwnable.Owner), nameof(IOwnableDto.OwnerName))]
+    public static partial void MapOwnable(IOwnable ownable, IOwnableDto ownableDto);
+}
+
+[Mapper]
+public static partial class HouseMapper
+{
+    // highlight-start
+    [IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(@BaseMapper.MapAudit))]
+    [IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(@BaseMapper.MapOwnable))]
+    // highlight-end
+    public static partial HouseDto ToDto(this House house);
+}
+```
+
+If several included configurations themselves include the same configuration, it is only applied once.
+
